 over five major island territories and various uninhabited islands in Oceania and the Caribbean. It is a megadiverse country, with the world's third-largest land area and third-largest population, exceeding 341 million. Paleo-Indians first migrated from North Asia to North America at least 15,000 years ago, and formed various civilizations."}}, {"canonical_name": "attraction", "category": "CONCEPT", "subcategory": "OTHER_CONCEPT", "book_count": 5, "total_mentions": 36, "members": [{"entity_id": "attraction", "book_id": "medecine_experimentale_bernard_1865", "name": "attraction", "category": "CONCEPT", "subcategory": "OTHER_CONCEPT", "count": 1, "variants": ["attraction"], "contexts": ["force drawing bodies together"]}, {"entity_id": "attraction", "book_id": "pseudodoxia_epidemica_browne_1646", "name": "attraction", "category": "CONCEPT", "subcategory": "OTHER_CONCEPT", "count": 5, "variants": ["Attraction", "attraction"], "contexts": ["force of pulling together", "force drawing objects together"]}, {"entity_id": "attraction", "book_id": "kosmos_humboldt_1845", "name": "attraction", "category": "CONCEPT", "subcategory": "OTHER_CONCEPT", "count": 7, "variants": ["attraction"], "contexts": ["force pulling objects together", "force drawing objects together"]}, {"entity_id": "attraction", "book_id": "connexion_physical_sciences_somerville_1858", "name": "attraction", "category": "CONCEPT", "subcategory": "OTHER_CONCEPT", "count": 20, "variants": ["attraction", "Attraction"], "contexts": ["force retaining celestial bodies in orbit", "force pulling bodies together"]}, {"entity_id": "attraction", "book_id": "first_principles_spencer_1862", "name": "attraction", "category": "CONCEPT", "subcategory": "OTHER_CONCEPT", "count": 3, "variants": ["attraction"], "contexts": ["forces of attraction and repulsion being universally co-existent", "force pulling objects together"]}], "edges": [{"source_book": "medecine_experimentale_bernard_1865", "source_name": "attraction", "target_bo