temperature. Many fish can communicate acoustically with each other, such as during courtship displays."}}, {"canonical_name": "continents", "category": "PLACE", "subcategory": "OTHER_PLACE", "book_count": 5, "total_mentions": 30, "members": [{"entity_id": "continents", "book_id": "pseudodoxia_epidemica_browne_1646", "name": "continents", "category": "PLACE", "subcategory": "OTHER_PLACE", "count": 1, "variants": ["continents"], "contexts": ["large landmasses"]}, {"entity_id": "continents", "book_id": "epoques_nature_buffon_1778", "name": "continents", "category": "PLACE", "subcategory": "OTHER_PLACE", "count": 9, "variants": ["continents"], "contexts": ["large landmasses", "large landmasses on Earth"]}, {"entity_id": "continents", "book_id": "origin_of_species_darwin_1859", "name": "continents", "category": "PLACE", "subcategory": "OTHER_PLACE", "count": 5, "variants": ["continents"], "contexts": ["landmasses where birds are brighter", "large landmasses"]}, {"entity_id": "continents", "book_id": "kosmos_humboldt_1845", "name": "continents", "category": "PLACE", "subcategory": "OTHER_PLACE", "count": 10, "variants": ["continents"], "contexts": ["land masses formed by distribution", "elevated landmasses above sea level"]}, {"entity_id": "continents", "book_id": "connexion_physical_sciences_somerville_1858", "name": "continents", "category": "PLACE", "subcategory": "OTHER_PLACE", "count": 5, "variants": ["continents"], "contexts": ["large landmasses on earth", "large landmasses on Earth"]}], "edges": [{"source_book": "pseudodoxia_epidemica_browne_1646", "source_name": "continents", "target_book": "epoques_nature_buffon_1778", "target_name": "continents", "similarity": 1.0}, {"source_book": "pseudodoxia_epidemica_browne_1646", "source_name": "continents", "target_book": "origin_of_species_darwin_1859", "target_name": "continents", "similarity": 1.0}, {"source_book": "pseudodoxia_epidemica_browne_1646", "source_name": "continents", "target_book": "kosmos_humboldt_1845", 