todextrins are potential risks for people with diabetes.", "description": "The process of breaking down food for absorption by the body.", "note": "Can refer to the physiological process or a chemical preparation."}}, {"canonical_name": "judgment", "category": "CONCEPT", "subcategory": "OTHER_CONCEPT", "book_count": 5, "total_mentions": 23, "members": [{"entity_id": "jugement", "book_id": "medecine_experimentale_bernard_1865", "name": "jugement", "category": "CONCEPT", "subcategory": "OTHER_CONCEPT", "count": 2, "variants": ["jugement"], "contexts": ["faculty of forming opinions or decisions", "the act of forming an opinion"]}, {"entity_id": "judgment", "book_id": "english_physician_1652", "name": "Judgment", "category": "CONCEPT", "subcategory": "OTHER_CONCEPT", "count": 1, "variants": ["Judgment"], "contexts": ["author's opinion on herb efficacy"]}, {"entity_id": "judgment", "book_id": "origin_of_species_darwin_1859", "name": "judgment", "category": "CONCEPT", "subcategory": "OTHER_CONCEPT", "count": 1, "variants": ["judgment"], "contexts": ["ability to make decisions"]}, {"entity_id": "judgment", "book_id": "principles_of_psychology_james_1890", "name": "judgment", "category": "CONCEPT", "subcategory": "OTHER_CONCEPT", "count": 16, "variants": ["Judgment", "judgment"], "contexts": ["faculty of forming opinions", "forming an opinion or conclusion"]}, {"entity_id": "judgment", "book_id": "first_principles_spencer_1862", "name": "judgment", "category": "CONCEPT", "subcategory": "OTHER_CONCEPT", "count": 3, "variants": ["judgment"], "contexts": ["formation of opinions and conclusions", "evaluation and decision-making"]}], "edges": [{"source_book": "medecine_experimentale_bernard_1865", "source_name": "jugement", "target_book": "english_physician_1652", "target_name": "Judgment", "similarity": 0.926}, {"source_book": "medecine_experimentale_bernard_1865", "source_name": "jugement", "target_book": "origin_of_species_darwin_1859", "target_name": "judgment", "similarity"