"region caliente", "similarity": 0.887}], "id": 2766, "stable_key": "clu_b2f0307463b73fb2", "ground_truth": {"modern_name": "hot region", "confidence": "high", "type": "place", "country": "Various", "wikipedia_extract": "\"Hot\" is a song recorded by South Korean girl group Le Sserafim for their fifth extended play of the same name. It was released as the EP's lead single by Source Music on March 14, 2025. The music video was released on the same day. A remix version of the track featuring English singer Jade, was released on April 14, 2025. On February 16, 2025, Source Music announced that Le Sserafim would release Hot, their fifth extended play, on March 14. A trailer, titled \"Born Fire,\" was released on February 21.", "wikipedia_url": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Hot_(Le_Sserafim_song)"}}, {"canonical_name": "celebro", "category": "SUBSTANCE", "subcategory": "OTHER_SUBSTANCE", "book_count": 2, "total_mentions": 11, "members": [{"entity_id": "celebro", "book_id": "quatro_libros_naturaleza_hernandez_1615", "name": "celebro", "category": "SUBSTANCE", "subcategory": "OTHER_SUBSTANCE", "count": 8, "variants": ["celebro"], "contexts": ["brain", "organ soothed by incense"]}, {"entity_id": "celebro", "book_id": "historia_medicinal_monardes_1574", "name": "celebro", "category": "SUBSTANCE", "subcategory": "ANATOMY", "count": 3, "variants": ["celebro", "celebros"], "contexts": ["the brain", "brain, strengthened by Ambar"]}], "edges": [{"source_book": "quatro_libros_naturaleza_hernandez_1615", "source_name": "celebro", "target_book": "historia_medicinal_monardes_1574", "target_name": "celebro", "similarity": 0.698}], "id": 2767, "stable_key": "clu_2fc3dbbadb5f8205", "ground_truth": {"modern_name": "Brain", "confidence": "high", "type": "organ", "note": "The Spanish term 'celebro' is a direct translation of 'brain'.", "wikidata_id": "Q16860338", "wikidata_description": "family name", "wikipedia_url": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Brain%20%28surname%29"}}, {"canonical_na