he rate of change of angular position whose direction is (if regarded as a vector) the axis of rotation"}}, {"canonical_name": "individuality", "category": "CONCEPT", "subcategory": "OTHER_CONCEPT", "book_count": 2, "total_mentions": 4, "members": [{"entity_id": "individualit\u00e9", "book_id": "relation_historique_humboldt_vol3_1825", "name": "individualit\u00e9", "category": "CONCEPT", "subcategory": "OTHER_CONCEPT", "count": 1, "variants": ["individualit\u00e9"], "contexts": ["individual character"]}, {"entity_id": "individuality", "book_id": "principles_of_psychology_james_1890", "name": "individuality", "category": "CONCEPT", "subcategory": "OTHER_CONCEPT", "count": 3, "variants": ["individuality"], "contexts": ["phrenological faculty for self", "quality of being individual"]}], "edges": [{"source_book": "relation_historique_humboldt_vol3_1825", "source_name": "individualit\u00e9", "target_book": "principles_of_psychology_james_1890", "target_name": "individuality", "similarity": 0.993}], "id": 4120, "stable_key": "clu_faa4e1003a62c811", "ground_truth": {"modern_name": "individuality", "confidence": "high", "type": "concept", "wikidata_id": "Q12964976", "wikidata_description": "characteristic that contributes to the differentiation or distinction of someone or something from a group of otherwise comparable identity"}}, {"canonical_name": "magnetic disturbance", "category": "CONCEPT", "subcategory": "OTHER_CONCEPT", "book_count": 2, "total_mentions": 4, "members": [{"entity_id": "perturbations_magn\u00e9tiques", "book_id": "relation_historique_humboldt_vol3_1825", "name": "Perturbations magn\u00e9tiques", "category": "CONCEPT", "subcategory": "OTHER_CONCEPT", "count": 1, "variants": ["Perturbations magn\u00e9tiques"], "contexts": ["magnetic disturbances between locations"]}, {"entity_id": "magnetic_disturbance", "book_id": "kosmos_humboldt_1845", "name": "magnetic disturbance", "category": "CONCEPT", "subcategory": "OTHER_CONCEPT", "count": 3, "variants": ["magn