 "confidence": "high", "type": "concept", "note": "Refers to substances with an ordered atomic structure, often appearing as crystals."}}, {"canonical_name": "astronomical observation", "category": "CONCEPT", "subcategory": "PRACTICE", "book_count": 2, "total_mentions": 3, "members": [{"entity_id": "astronomical_observation", "book_id": "kosmos_humboldt_1845", "name": "astronomical observation", "category": "CONCEPT", "subcategory": "OTHER_CONCEPT", "count": 1, "variants": ["astronomical observation"], "contexts": ["observing celestial bodies"]}, {"entity_id": "astronomical_observation", "book_id": "connexion_physical_sciences_somerville_1858", "name": "astronomical observation", "category": "CONCEPT", "subcategory": "PRACTICE", "count": 2, "variants": ["astronomical observation"], "contexts": ["observing celestial bodies", "of Eudoxus"]}], "edges": [{"source_book": "kosmos_humboldt_1845", "source_name": "astronomical observation", "target_book": "connexion_physical_sciences_somerville_1858", "target_name": "astronomical observation", "similarity": 1.0}], "id": 4906, "stable_key": "clu_23bc638388c28194", "ground_truth": {"modern_name": "astronomical observation", "confidence": "high", "type": "concept"}}, {"canonical_name": "material power", "category": "CONCEPT", "subcategory": "OTHER_CONCEPT", "book_count": 2, "total_mentions": 3, "members": [{"entity_id": "material_power", "book_id": "kosmos_humboldt_1845", "name": "material power", "category": "CONCEPT", "subcategory": "OTHER_CONCEPT", "count": 1, "variants": ["material power"], "contexts": ["power derived from natural forces"]}, {"entity_id": "physical_powers", "book_id": "kosmos_humboldt_1845", "name": "physical powers", "category": "CONCEPT", "subcategory": "OTHER_CONCEPT", "count": 1, "variants": ["physical powers"], "contexts": ["bodily and physical capabilities"]}, {"entity_id": "physical_power", "book_id": "first_principles_spencer_1862", "name": "physical power", "category": "CONCEPT", "subcategory": "OT